         // surf_area handles the surcharge regime smoothly, no dQ/dH branch).
+        // Likewise for any node whose links all have dqdh = 0, such as a
+        // junction drained only by outlets (whose DUMMY section sets its
+        // crown): the dQ/dH branch would give dy = 0 and lose its inflow.
         if (!use_surcharge_dqdh ||
-            (is_storage && xnode_.sumdqdh[ui] == 0.0)) {
